WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.500
Mistake 1 of 8 — What went wrong: side-to-side swaying instead of a circle.

00:01.500 --> 00:04.200
The fix: complete each small circle first.

00:04.200 --> 00:07.500
Then move outward gently along the brow.

00:07.500 --> 00:11.000
Keep your supporting hand steady and pressure comfortable.
